        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana HPA69, Hinge Pin Mounted Door Stop</b> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door stop is mounted on a door hinge pin instead of on the floor or baseboard. Easily adjustable, simple to use, out of the way and out of sight. Very popular and available in 10 great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with most common residential door hinges (3.5\" x 3.5\" and 4\" x 4\" door hinges). They work with all hinges that have a hinge pin of 1/4\" diameter or less. Not for use with Heavy Duty ball bearing hinges. For hinge pins larger than 1/4\" please use <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-universal-hinge-pin-door-stop-deltana-hp70\">Deltana HP70 Hinge Pin Door Stop</a>.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe door opening adjustment range is approximately from 90 degrees to 140 degrees. Note that the thickness of the jamb moulding and the distance of the hinge pin from the door face will affect the adjustment range for each application. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-HPA69-specifications.gif?v=1704354547\" width=\"410\" height=\"147\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Hinge Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana HPA69 Hinge Pin Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin Diameter: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Opening Range: 90 - 140 Degrees, Approximate</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/rubber-replacement-tip-for-hinge-pin-door-stop-deltana-hpa69-rubber-tips\"><b>Rubber Bumpers</b></a>: 5/8\" Diameter, Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HPA69.pdf?v=1704262156\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana HPA69 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
